00:48:12,110 --> 00:48:13,690
to understand their speech.

912
00:48:13,690 --> 00:48:19,140

913
00:48:19,140 --> 00:48:22,470
So between these,
we've explored a lot

914
00:48:22,470 --> 00:48:25,830
of different configurations,
trying to consider similarities

915
00:48:25,830 --> 00:48:28,290
