00:48:34,230 --> 00:48:38,040
Thinking about bit-cipher
embeddings that are 500

919
00:48:38,040 --> 00:48:41,230
dimensional or 1,000 dimensional
to be something like a GPT-2.

920
00:48:41,230 --> 00:48:46,590
That's again pointing towards
the big/large category of models

921
00:48:46,590 --> 00:48:48,870
that we've experimented with.

922
00:48:48,870 --> 00:48:52,440
Beyond that, we haven't
really touched those scales

923
00:48:52,440 --> 00:48:57,240
because our first objective is
not to make big, big language

924
00:48:57,240 --> 00:48:58,900
models and train chatbots.

925
00:48:58,900 --> 00:49:01,530
We want to know, what can
we do with a small model

926
00:49:01,530 --> 00:49:04,300
since this is a relatively
unique capability?

927
00:49:04,300 --> 00:49:09,390

928
00:49:09,390 --> 00:49:11,820
So what does training look like?

929
00:49:11,820 --> 00:49:19,050
To the best of our ability so
