952
00:50:31,450 --> 00:50:35,440
beyond their warm
starts very, very fast

953
00:50:35,440 --> 00:50:39,730
using that vector caching,
the vector comparison caching

954
00:50:39,730 --> 00:50:42,880
to avoid the quadratic
costs of self-attention.

955
00:50:42,880 --> 00:50:46,090
This articulates the
parameters in the middle layers

956
00:50:46,090 --> 00:50:50,780
of the model for taking
100 million tokens

957
00:50:50,780 --> 00:50:55,990
and making five passes over
the data here a lot quicker

958
00:50:55,990 --> 00:50:57,350
than any of the other stages.

959
00:50:57,350 --> 00:50:59,740
And the comparison
that you'd make to this

960
00:50:59,740 --> 00:51:04,900
is the training time once those
embedding layers are unfrozen,

961
00:51:04,900 --> 00:51:08,290
where everything slows down
