982
00:52:06,120 --> 00:52:12,930
before leaving this slide is
in phase 1, how the warm start

983
00:52:12,930 --> 00:52:15,460
saturates pretty quickly?

984
00:52:15,460 --> 00:52:16,920
So if you have 100
million tokens,

